	<u><strong>Air Fryer Chicken Thighs</strong></u>
	<br>2025-04-21</br>
	<p>These air fryer chicken thighs are SO easy and my family loves them! Juicy, savory, and a little crisped and browned on the outside. One of our favorite easy dinners!</p>
